   "widgets_values": [
    "## 1 · Input\nLoad **one** picture of your character (full body, front facing works best).\n\n* Background is removed with BiRefNet and the character is centred on a white canvas.\n* `Normalize pose` (optional, off by default): Qwen-Image-Edit redraws the character front-facing, eyes open, mouth closed, arms slightly away from the body — the pose Live2D/StandRig rigs need. Turn it on when your picture is a dynamic pose or 3/4 view.\n* Everything downstream uses the **source canvas** from `StandRig Prepare Canvas`."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
